PARITY (web source → native), every web branch reproduced
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  • AccordionSection (Satellite icon, "Service Health" / "Fleet Telemetry streaming
    status", header badges)                     → ServiceHealthAccordion + trailing badge cluster
  • Badge Enabled/Disabled (success/neutral, dot) + Badge info "{activeCount} streaming"
                                                 → ServiceHealthHeaderBadges (dotted + info pill)
  • isLoading → <Skeleton h-48>                  → phase .loading → ServiceHealthLoading (grid+table skeleton)
  • error → <QueryError onRetry>                 → phase .error → ServiceHealthError (retry)
  • !data → <EmptyState "No telemetry data available"> → phase .empty → ServiceHealthEmpty
  • Grid 2/4 of <MetricCard> (Mode / Vehicles Connected / Total Signals / Avg Signals/s)
                                                 → ServiceHealthMetricGrid (TSStatCard x4, icon+label+value)
  • <DataTable> VIN / Status / Signals(sortable) / Signals/s / Latency / Last Received,
    emptyMessage "No vehicles connected"         → ServiceHealthVehiclesTable (TSDataTable, 6 TSColumn)
  • Badge dot Streaming/Idle per row             → ServiceVehicleStatusBadge
  • fmtInt / fmtNumber(_,1) / fmtNumber(_,0)+" ms" / formatDateTime ("—" fallback)
                                                 → ServiceHealthFormat (locale-aware, em-dash contract)
  Native-only P4 additions (prompt-mandated states/HIG, no web equivalent — declared,
